{"id":"vod_md_6363","vodId":"6363","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"剃须。然后捡到女高中生。","name_cn":"剃须。然后捡到女高中生。","date":"2021-01-01","year":"2021","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231030-1/25901c2e4fc481af5c666df357eccdef.jpg"},"summary":"吉田（兴津和幸 配音）是一名非常平凡的上班族，在公司里，他有一个非常仰慕的前辈后藤爱依梨（金元寿子 配音），吉田暗恋她长达5年之久。终于有一天，当吉田鼓起勇气将自己的感情告诉后藤后，却得到了非常干脆的拒绝。心灰意冷的吉田只能借酒消愁，喝的醉醺醺返回家中的路上，吉田邂逅了坐在路边的女子高中生沙优（市之濑加那 配音），看着无处可去的可怜少女，被酒精冲昏了头脑的吉田收留了无家可归的沙优。哪知道，沙优就决定这样赖在吉田家不走了。吉田没办法狠下心来赶走沙优，于是，以做家务为交换条件，吉田和沙优开始了在同一屋檐下生活的日子。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-30 09:32:15","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/dRgzEzfS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/c5e370g3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/j8TQxRy0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/UpXA9rkp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/eyioTrN1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/FWMhdSvE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/HYKWBqq6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/sijoua4x/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/uwGUcdqL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/N3b0U4H5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/885jhWBS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/jpf3TIvF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/UXb86tIg/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:30:23.123Z"}